<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89657" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσκρεμάννῡμι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hang</i> a thing <i>on</i> or
				<i>to</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν θήκας προσκρεμῶσι τοῖς στελέχεσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					10.5
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be hung up to, hang up</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				131
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσκρέμᾰμαι</span></b> ,
				<i>to be attached</i> or <i>suspended</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὸ ἔμβρυον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Superf.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mech.</u>
				856a23
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.10.4
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
